2. DATA — Data Use Agreement
   Applies to: data/public/*.parquet, data/public/README.md,
               data/public/validacion.txt
====================================================================

The k-anonymized datasets in data/public/ are released under the
following terms:

a) ATTRIBUTION. Any use, analysis, or visualization derived from the
   data must credit: "Andrés Gómez · Agri-industrial Data Analyst."

b) NON-COMMERCIAL USE. The data may be used for educational, research,
   and portfolio-demonstration purposes only. Commercial exploitation
   requires prior written consent from the author.

c) NO RE-IDENTIFICATION. You must not attempt to identify, profile,
   or infer the identity of any individual, worker, farm, or
   organization from the data, nor link the data with external sources
   for that purpose.

d) NO RAW REDISTRIBUTION. You may publish analyses, charts, and derived
   works, but must not redistribute the original parquet files without
   this license attached.

e) DISCLAIMER. The data are provided "as is" for demonstration purposes.
   No warranty is expressed or implied regarding accuracy, completeness,
   or fitness for any particular purpose.

